#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -euo pipefail

cat >&2 <<'EOF'
warexo-reset is intentionally not destructive inside the running container.

Warexo development instances are disposable. To return to a clean installation:
1. delete the Coolify Compose resource and its named volumes
2. create a new resource from compose.coolify.example.yaml
3. run the Warexo installer against the fresh database

This avoids mixing database schemas from different Git revisions.
EOF
exit 2
